# TypeOK pairing: a start writes a record state the lifecycle does not declare.
MODULE: TypeOKBeginUndeclaredState
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an admitted start records a state outside the operation lifecycle
PERTURBS: Begin

--- FIND
    /\ opState' = [opState EXCEPT ![o] = "Queued"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ opState' = [opState EXCEPT ![o] = "Started"]
--- END
